Cell["\<\
It appears on this evidence that the adjustment \[Sigma] = 1 \[RightArrow] 2 \
has not increased the noise level of the statistics, has not brought about \
violation of the Semicircular Law; its only effect has been to increase the \
value of the greatest eigenvalue (radius of the Wigner semicircle), by a \
factor of about\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5202621448807487`*^9, 3.520262272818117*^9}, {
  3.520262319058753*^9, 3.520262324471953*^9}}],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

